   "titulo": "Impersonal uses",
   "texto": [
    "**Conviene**, **occorre**, **basta**, **vale la pena** can go with infinitive: **Conviene partire presto** (it is appropriate to leave early).",
    "With an infinitive they usually go in third person singular; with a nominal subject they can also agree: **Occorrono due documenti**, **Bastano pochi minuti**."
